ite dance session as stress relief and to fuel her creativity for her online store.\n  - new store: Gina designed a cozy, inviting new store space perfect for customers to check out trendy pieces. Jon is still searching for a place for his dance studio.\n  - Gina: Gina designed her cozy, inviting store herself, featuring trendy pieces and comfy furniture. A chandelier adds a glam feel to the space designed for customers.\n  - sales: Gina is focused on growing her customer base, seeing more sales due to new offers and promotions on her online store, and looking for unique, trendy pieces.\n  - clothing store: Gina started an online clothing store; she built a new website for customer orders and got noticed by fashion editors. Jon congratulated her.\n  - fashion fans: Gina is focused on making her online store a top destination for fashion fans.\n  - Gina: Gina is an assistant who conversed with Jon about his new dance studio business, encouraging him after he lost his job.\n  - new offers and promotions: Gina is using new offers and promotions in her online store, which customers love, to drive sales and grow her customer base while starting her business.\n  - Gina: Gina started an online clothing store after losing her job to take control of her destiny. The journey has been tough but rewarding. She encouraged Jon to believe in himself.\n  - fashion: Gina secured a part-time fashion internship at an international company, expressing excitement and nervousness about the big change.\n  - Gina: Gina built a new customer ordering website, offered support to Jon about his dance studio struggles, and plans to manage his social media and create content.\n  - Gina: Gina is experiencing an exciting but scary time after being noticed by fashion editors. She encourages Jon to keep pursuing his business dreams.\n  - trophy: Gina shared one of her dance contest trophies with Jon as a reminder of the hard work, dedication, and joy dance brings.\n  - furniture and decor: Gina desig