urrently preparing for other tournaments.\n  - setback: Nate experienced a setback in a video game tournament after previously winning an international tournament. Joanna expressed sympathy for the setback.\n  - Street Fighter: Nate is really good at Street Fighter, playing it often with friends, and recently competed in a local tournament for the game.\n  - Counter-Strike: Global Offensive: Nate usually plays CS:GO and recently won his second tournament. His previous tournament win was playing Counter-Strike: Global Offensive with his team.\n  - Nate: Nate made homemade coconut ice cream with sprinkles. His game tournament was postponed, and he didn't make the finals. He creates YouTube gaming content. He expressed support for Joanna filming her movie.\n  - goals: Joanna supports Nate in reaching his goals, and Nate will try again after not making the finals in his game tournament.\n  - Nate: Nate praised Joanna for setting up meetings with movie producers, comparing her success to winning a video game tournament, and expressed pride in her feeling hopeful and inspired.\n  - tournament: Nate's game tournament was pushed back, and he did not make it to the finals. He plans to win the next time.\n  - passion: Joanna's writing is a huge part of her; Nate turned his passion for gaming into a career by winning an international tournament.\n  - gaming: Nate's game tournament was postponed, and he did not make it to the finals, but he intends to compete again.\n  - Nate: Nate congratulated Joanna on filming her movie from the road-trip script and asked about the coolest moment on set. He previously tried making coconut ice cream and had a game tournament pushed back.\n  - gaming tournaments: Nate's game tournament was pushed back. He did not make it to the finals but plans to join a new gaming team after his next tournament.\n  - favorite game: Joanna asked Nate what his favorite game is after he won a Valorant tournament.\n  - practice: Joanna suggests that practice is i