rney, confirmed by Dave who congratulated him on a gala attendance and upcoming performance. Dave is keen to hear about it and see a show in Boston.\n  - harmonious day: Calvin wished Dave a harmonious day ahead after discussing the challenges of fame and managing personal life during a Frank Ocean tour.\n  - power and happiness: Calvin mentioned the feeling of power and happiness is amazing, stemming from seeing what they created with hard work and ideas.\n  - brand: Calvin plans to explore and grow his brand after an upcoming tour. The current brand goal is worldwide expansion, fanbase growth, reaching more people, and collaborating with global artists.\n  - headliner: Calvin asked Dave who the headliner was at an event where Dave took an awesome picture, noting the crowd looked excited and the stage was incredible.\n  - Dave: Dave inquired about Calvin's tour with Frank Ocean, the impact of fame on relationships, and how Calvin manages his job and personal life.\n  - expertise: Calvin is feeling confident and excited to show off their car, trusting someone's expertise in fixing it after an accident.\n  - new experience: Calvin got a new luxury car which feels amazing, smooth, and powerful, fulfilling a dream.\n  - Ratatouille: Calvin mentioned that Ratatouille is one of his favorites and that it's about pursuing what you love.\n  - documentaries about artists and their creative process: Calvin watches documentaries about artists and their creative process for inspiration and to learn about the music industry. Calvin asked Dave if a notebook helps him stay connected to the creative process.\n  - show: Calvin is set to perform at an upcoming show in Boston, and Dave looks forward to hearing about it and possibly attending.\n  - Calvin: Calvin had an inspiring chat with an artist about music and art, feeling a creative high. He and Dave previously planned to meet when Dave is in Boston. Dave has taken up photography.\n  - podcast: Calvin recorded a podcast following