ds working on a car to be therapeutic and relaxing (event_time: 2023-10-04T14:44:00Z)\n  - Dave is currently working on his latest car project. (event_time: 2023-10-25T20:25:00Z)\n  - Refurbishing cars gives Dave a sense of fulfillment. (event_time: 2023-08-03T13:12:00Z)\n  - Dave is involved in working on cars. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Dave is currently working on a new car that presents a challenge. (event_time: 2023-10-23T14:17:00Z)\n  - Dave considers fixing cars to be like therapy for him. (event_time: 2023-08-03T13:12:00Z)\n  - Dave has a dream of working on classic cars. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Dave is currently working with cars. (event_time: 2023-08-11T17:22:00Z)\n  - Dave works on all kinds of cars at his shop. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Dave feels like he is connecting back with himself when working on cars. (event_time: 2023-10-23T14:17:00Z)\n  - Dave views cars as an outlet for self-expression. (event_time: 2023-10-23T14:17:00Z)\n  - Dave gets a sense of purpose from fixing up a car. (event_time: 2023-09-02T09:19:00Z)\n  - Dave has been working on auto engineering ever since his initial experience with cars. (event_time: 2013-10-23T14:17:00Z)\n  - Dave finds doing working on cars every day rewarding. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - The car Dave is working on is a classic muscle car. (event_time: 2023-08-11T17:22:00Z)\n  - Dave is working on customizing the car. (event_time: 2023-08-11T17:22:00Z)\n  - Dave is pursuing his passion for auto engineering. (event_time: 2023-08-11T17:22:00Z)\n  - Dave grew up working on cars with his dad. (event_time: 2023-08-03T13:12:00Z)\n  - Dave has always wanted to work on building a custom car. (event_time: 2023-08-11T17:22:00Z)\n  - Calvin believes that Dave's working on cars must be really rewarding. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Calvin shares with Dave that the feeling (of performing/working on cars) is amazing (event_time: 2023-05-31T18:06:00Z)\n  - Dave i