ains. It explicitly states that Evan watched the waves at the beach and took pictures there, indicating proximity to the beach. Additionally, it mentions that Evan stayed in a cabin surrounded by mountains, confirming his connection to both geographical features. The golden answer specifies 'beach,' which is supported by multiple facts in the context.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Evan watched the waves at the beach","Evan took a picture at his favorite spot by the beach","Evan stayed in a cabin surrounded by mountains"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_9","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_9_qa_132","category":"4","difficulty":"unknown","query":"How does Calvin describe his music in relation to capturing feelings?","golden_answer":"Express himself and work through his emotions","hypothesis":"Calvin describes his music as a means to capture the feelings derived from people's struggles. He is digging deeper into his music recently to achieve this connection and aims for his music to convey his experiences and emotions.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Calvin uses his music to share his experiences and feelings (event_time: 2023-10-23T14:17:00Z)\n  - Calvin pours his heart into music within his creative haven. (event_time: 2023-05-16T11:50:00Z)\n  - Calvin's music conveys his feelings (event_time: 2023-10-23T14:17:00Z)\n  - Music has a way of touching Calvin's soul (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - Calvin's music is a source for sharing his experiences (ev