ifferent from her previous work but has potential to be great. (event_time: 2022-07-10T14:34:00Z)\n  - Joanna cannot stop thinking about the screenplay (event_time: 2022-02-25T13:07:00Z)\n  - Joanna hopes a producer will fall in love with her screenplay. (event_time: 2022-02-07T09:27:00Z)\n  - Joanna hopes her screenplay ends up on the big screen. (event_time: 2022-02-07T09:27:00Z)\n  - The screenplay helps Joanna get through times of anxiousness. (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Movies can make Joanna feel many emotions. (event_time: 2022-10-09T10:58:00Z)\n  - Joanna just finished submitting her recent screenplay to a film contest (event_time: 2022-06-24T10:55:00Z)\n  - Nate is eager to hear about Joanna's screenplay submission. (event_time: 2022-06-24T10:55:00Z)\n  - Joanna submitted her screenplay to the film festival. (event_time: 2022-02-07T09:27:00Z)\n  - Joanna has mixed emotions regarding the audition for the writing gig. (event_time: 2022-03-24T13:43:00Z)\n  - Nate asked Joanna how she feels now that the screenplay is finished. (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna has been working on a screenplay. (event_time: 2022-05-02T11:54:00Z)\n  - Joanna's screenplay might be loved by a director. (event_time: 2022-02-07T09:27:00Z)\n  - Joanna has an opportunity to pitch her script. (event_time: 2022-11-09T17:54:00Z)\n  - Joanna recalls the difficult process of finishing her screenplay. (event_time: 2022-05-25T15:00:00Z)\n  - Writing gives Joanna a chance to put down all her feelings (event_time: 2022-08-14T18:12:00Z)\n  - Joanna appreciates Nate's support regarding her screenplay. (event_time: 2022-02-25T13:07:00Z)\n  - Joanna intends for producers to check out the screenplay (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna pitched the script to some producers (event_time: 2022-11-08T17:54:00Z)\n  - Joanna plans to submit the screenplay to film festivals (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna intends for directors to check out the screenplay (ev